            "body": "The `tangle` check fails on `sp-litnotes-refs.el` and `sp-litnotes-titles.el`, which this PR does not touch. The same drift shows up when tangling `main` at `8fef5c0` (after #508), so it comes from #508 and not from this change. The two files this PR changes, `sp-bibprocess.el` and `sp-batch-report.el`, match their docs. I am leaving the drift alone here so this PR stays in scope. It needs a re-tangle of those two docs in a separate PR.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
